{
    "title": "Freepik: Design & edit with AI",
    "description": "Welcome to Freepik, your go-to app for all your design needs!\r\n\r\nCreate stunning designs with easy-to-use design tools like the Freepik AI image generator on your iPhone or iPad. Discover Freepik evergreen stock library, including icons, vectors, images, PSD, templates, videos, and mockups. Make your designs pop with must-try features like background remover and Reimagine. Here\u2019s a list of the most popular ones:\r\n\r\n- Freepik Designer: Your online editor to create or edit your designs with top AI tools and features. Perfect for personalizing logos, posts, invitations, business cards, posters, and templates with your unique touch.\r\n- Photo editor: Fine-tune your images with this intuitive online tool. Adjust colors, apply filters, and make your images look their best effortlessly.\r\n- Background remover: Remove backgrounds in a snap and get your photos ready for any project. Just take a photo or pick one from your gallery. With one click, the background is gone. Then you can either add a new background or download the image as a PNG file instantly.\r\n- Freepik AI image generator: Create images instantly using your own words with our AI-powered text-to-image tool. Experiment with a variety of models to choose, whether you're looking for high quality or faster generation, Flux variants or Freepik Mystic will cover your needs. Play around with Structure and use any image to match your image\u2019s overall structure and form.\r\n- Reimagine: Generate multiple variations of any image in real time and explore different styles to match your creative vision. You can recreate an image as many times as you want, preserving the composition at all times.\r\n- Sketch to image: Turn a doodle into detailed images in real-time. Upload your drawing or create one on a blank canvas, and our AI will bring it to life, turning your ideas into reality.\r\n\r\nDownload the APP today, and let\u2019s make something beautiful together!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Freepik, your go-to app for all your design needs!<br><br>Create stunning designs with easy-to-use design tools like the Freepik AI image generator on your iPhone or iPad. Discover Freepik evergreen stock library, including icons, vectors, images, PSD, templates, videos, and mockups. Make your designs pop with must-try features like background remover and Reimagine. Here\u2019s a list of the most popular ones:<br><br>- Freepik Designer: Your online editor to create or edit your designs with top AI tools and features. Perfect for personalizing logos, posts, invitations, business cards, posters, and templates with your unique touch.<br>- Photo editor: Fine-tune your images with this intuitive online tool. Adjust colors, apply filters, and make your images look their best effortlessly.<br>- Background remover: Remove backgrounds in a snap and get your photos ready for any project. Just take a photo or pick one from your gallery. With one click, the background is gone. Then you can either add a new background or download the image as a PNG file instantly.<br>- Freepik AI image generator: Create images instantly using your own words with our AI-powered text-to-image tool. Experiment with a variety of models to choose, whether you&#39;re looking for high quality or faster generation, Flux variants or Freepik Mystic will cover your needs. Play around with Structure and use any image to match your image\u2019s overall structure and form.<br>- Reimagine: Generate multiple variations of any image in real time and explore different styles to match your creative vision. You can recreate an image as many times as you want, preserving the composition at all times.<br>- Sketch to image: Turn a doodle into detailed images in real-time. Upload your drawing or create one on a blank canvas, and our AI will bring it to life, turning your ideas into reality.<br><br>Download the APP today, and let\u2019s make something beautiful together!",
    "summary": "AI image generator, BG remover, vectors, icons, templates, PSD, videos & mockups",
